---
import SectionLayout from "./SectionLayout.astro";
---

<SectionLayout sectionId="contact" sectionName="contact" sectionClass="contact-section">
  <div class="contact-wrapper">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h2>마지막 확인</h2>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <section aria-labelledby="format-title">
        <h3 id="format-title">진행 방식</h3>
        <p>무박 2일 현장 해커톤으로 운영되며, 주제는 대회 당일 현장에서 공개됩니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="eligibility-title">
        <h3 id="eligibility-title">참가 대상</h3>
        <p>국민대학교, 숭실대학교, 순천향대학교 소속 대학생 누구나 지원할 수 있습니다. 전공 무관이며 휴학생도 포함됩니다.</p>
      </section>

      <address class="mail-card" aria-label="문의 이메일">
        <span class="mail-icon" aria-hidden="true">@</span>
        <div>
          <span>문의처</span>
          <a href="mailto:kosscch3@gmail.com">kosscch3@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </address>
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionLayout>

<style>
  .contact-wrapper {
    width: min(100%, 960px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--kosscch-blue);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .contact-grid section,
  .mail-card {
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 34px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(101, 168, 255, 0.28);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(3, 12, 31, 0.74);
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
  }

  h3 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  p {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: rgba(235, 245, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .mail-card {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .mail-icon {
    width: 64px;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(0, 79, 159, 0.28);
    color: var(--kosscch-cyan);
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .mail-card span:not(.mail-icon) {
    display: block;
    color: var(--kosscch-blue);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .mail-card a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 900;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .mail-card a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--kosscch-cyan);
    outline-offset: 4px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .contact-grid section,
    .mail-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .mail-card {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
